{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111781","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111781/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111781/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111781/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111781","id":3528005057,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7SSRXB","number":111781,"title":"No funciona lapiz Cintiq 13","user":{"login":"janetromero","id":60352525,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMzUyNTI1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60352525?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/janetromero","html_url":"https://github.com/janetromero","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janetromero/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janetromero/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janetromero/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janetromero/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janetromero/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janetromero/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janetromero/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janetromero/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janetromero/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-10-18T03:15:07Z","updated_at":"2025-10-30T09:09:05Z","closed_at":"2025-10-30T09:09:00Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nCordial saludo.\nUso una Wacom Cintiq 13 y sí funciona cuando oprimo un botón con el lapiz en Godot 4.3. Tal y como se ve en la imagen, la ventana Crear Nuevo Proyecto se desplega:\n\n<img width=\"865\" height=\"498\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cf20a911-5b71-447e-8a26-106ee4cdbfe4\" />\n\nPero el lapiz de la Cintiq 13 no funciona cuando oprimo un botón en Godot 4.5.1:\n\n<img width=\"805\" height=\"484\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ca8c9596-de81-45bc-b3b8-cb291db7a98e\" />\n\nGracias por la atención.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.1.stable - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL ES 3/ANGLE (Compatibility) - ANGLE (Intel, Intel(R) HD Graphics 4600 (0x00000412) Direct3D11 vs_5_0 ps_5_0, D3D11-20.19.15.4963) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-4765T CPU @ 2.00GHz (8 threads) - 7.90 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nEl error consiste en que la versión 4.5.1 no funciona bien el lápiz de la Cintiq 13, cuando se oprimen botones. Sí funciona en los menús. Es decir, sí funciona en el caso, por ejemplo, en el proceso menú Ayuda --> Copiar Información del Sistema. Pero no funciona cuando oprimo, por ejemplo, el botón Reproducir Proyecto.\n\nEl lápiz sí funciona en Godot 4.3.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nPASOS:\n1) Dar clic en el botón +Crear en la ventana Administrador de Proyectos, con el lápiz.\n2) La ventana de Nuevo Proyecto debe desplegarse.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nNO APLICA.","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_ur